Over 60% of the visitors to music related websites are independent DJ's/musicians/artist/songwriters looking for resources to help them further their careers. <br> <br> Every year, hundreds of thousands of these DJ's/musicians/artist/songwriters dream of making it big, but know the difficulty that they face trying to get work spinning, get signed to a major record label or getting their music published by one of the "big" publishers. <br> <br> Because of the hassles involved with trying to find work, getting signed to a major label, the majority of these DJ's/musicians/artist have learned that increasing their professionalism or starting their own indie label is the best way to increase their chances at success. <br> <br> Recent surveys conducted have shown that indie Dj's/Musicians and startups often face two problems when it comes down to handling the legal side of starting a record label. <br> <br> Either they; <br> (1)-Operate on limited budgets and cannot afford to pay an entertainment lawyer to draw up legal contracts, or <br> (2)-Don't know where to find the professional legal services they need.<br /><br />Our collection of standard music industry form contracts has proven to be a best seller among DJ's, musicians, artist and songwriters World-Wide and in addition to being available on our website www.order-yours-now.com , our contracts are also sold on amazon.com and cdstreet.com or by calling our toll free # 1-877-692-7999 to place your order by credit card.<br /><br />Our form contracts can be used with all genres of music from indie rock, ska, hip-hop, jazz, r&b, rock, country, jazz, hip-hop, pop, alternative or any and everything in-between...<br /><br />The goal is to help educate the indie music community on the importance of properly handling the "business" part of their careers. <br> <br> Remember the music business is 1 part music, 2 parts business.<br /><br />Thank You, <br> T.E.Cohen III <br> TopNotchProducts@hotmail.com <br> http://www.order-yours-now.com<br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Extras <br>&nbsp;<a href="search.php?topic=32"><b>More DJ News</b></a><br> <br><hr noshade size="1"> <b>Most read story in DJ News:</b><br>
