Finally a huge advancement in music and culture! If you aren't already aware of Fischerspooner, believe us when we tell you to listen up. <br><br>Formed in 1998 in New York, multi-media performance troupe Fischerspooner is already a global sensation. Spawning a chart-topping European club hit with "Emerge," performing in New York's most exclusive galleries, and appearing in high-profile publications from Life to Vanity Fair to Urb, Fischerspooner is at the cusp of mainstream culture's changing tides. <br> <br> As Madonna's most recent world tour incorporated Fischerspooner-esque imagery, and billion-dollar fashion designers perpetually emulate their costumes, the corporate harvesting of the underground marches on. <br> <br> <b>LIVE IN NYC</b> <br> Deitch Projects<br> May 15, 16, 17 (shows at 8 PM and 10 PM) <br> <br> <b>Other Links</b> <br> · <a href="http://www.fischerspooner.com/sub_music.html">More Info & Audio Tracks</a> <br> &nbsp; &nbsp; Extras <br>&nbsp;<a href="search.php?topic=35"><b>More Events</b></a><br> <br><hr noshade size="1"> <b>Most read story in Events:</b><br>
