SuperJane, the top US female House Music collective will embark upon a European tour kicking off in Germany this January.<br><br>Comprised of members DJ Colette, DJ Heather, Dayhota and Lady D, the women have appearances scheduled Jan 18 at Zapata (Stuttgart Germany) and Jan 19th at The Loft (MannHeim Germany). From there the women will appear at the Midem conference to take place in Cannes, France Jan 20-24. Singer/Producer Ron Carroll (of Virgin Records/SuperFunk fame) is hosting an event for his independent dance label Body Music which recently released a 12" single "Making Sweet Love" featuring Lady D. After Midem it is off to Thessaloniki Greece for a party Saturday January 26th. <br><br> For more info, see www.djcolette.com, www.djladyd.com and www.midem.net. <br> &nbsp; &nbsp; Extras <br>&nbsp;<a href="search.php?topic=30"><b>More Announcements</b></a><br> <br><hr noshade size="1"> <b>Most read story in Announcements:</b><br>
