Fatboy Slim and Timo Maas will play an unprecedented DJ spinoff in Brighton, UK. <br><br>According to BBC, the line up at the Dome will includes Midfield General, Jean Jacques Smoothie, Trevor Jackson (Playgroup) and a very special live act - still to be confirmed. <br> <br> Although they havfe been friends for quite sometime, Timo and Fatboy will be playing in separate rooms at the same time. <br> <br> Timo says: "We hung around in a club, had a couple of drinks and by the end of the night we did this handshake gentlemen agreement." <br> <br> "These are things that sometimes happen when you are travelling a lot and meeting interesting or important people." <br> <br> The event takes place on April 13 in Brighton. <br><br> <b>Other Links</b> <br> · <a href="article.php?storyid=149">Timo Maas is Back</a> <br> &nbsp; &nbsp; Extras <br>&nbsp;<a href="search.php?topic=35"><b>More Events</b></a><br> <br><hr noshade size="1"> <b>Most read story in Events:</b><br>
