Death in Vegas is releasing a new album. Get the details and listen to their first single from the album right here on internetdj. <br><br>Death in Vegas release their new album 'Scorpio Rising', described by them as a series of "psychedelic love songs" in September. Richard and Ian got the name from Kenneth Anger's 1964 film of the same name, a 29 minute blitzkrieg of biker and religious imagery. The LP will include several collaborations, including tracks with Liam Gallagher, Paul Weller and Detroit techno outfit 'Adult'.<br /> <br /> In October they'll play their first dates in over two years in with many of the musicians from the album. The dates are as follows:<br /> <br /> OCTOBER<br /> 9th: WOLVERHAMPTON Wulfren Hall<br /> 10th: DUBLIN Ambassador<br /> 11th: BELFAST Limelight<br /> 12th: GLASGOW QMU<br /> 14th: MANCHESTER University<br /> 15th: LEEDS University<br /> 16th: BRISTOL Academy<br /> 17th: BRIGHTON Concorde 2<br /> 19th: LONDON Hackney Ocean<br /> <br /> Death in Vegas will also launch 'The Contino Rooms', a virtual village with inhabitants brought to life through animation and interaction. Through the 'Rooms' Richard (and friends) hope to engage fans and the public on a level that is innovative and surreal but always twisted. <br /> <br /> Listen to the single, <b>Leather Girls</b> <br> <a href="http://mcms-delivery.virtuebroadcasting.com/deliverMedia.asp?id=547E0404-7481-41BB-9C20-EE88F67A020E&delivery=stream"><b>Lo</b></a> <a href="http://mcms-delivery.virtuebroadcasting.com/deliverMedia.asp?id=8355EA79-0CD0-4B24-BCD5-AC51D65F7F31&delivery=stream"><b>Hi</b></a> (Windows Media) <br> &nbsp; &nbsp; Extras <br>&nbsp;<a href="search.php?topic=33"><b>More Music News</b></a><br> <br><hr noshade size="1"> <b>Most read story in Music News:</b><br>
