DJ Peter K releases <b>It's Me</b> (phood records uk). Check out this up and coming artist right here on internetdj. <br><br>'It's Me' has had an encouraging first week with great DJ support. The Plastic Avengers mix is proving most popular at this stage but we have also seen support, most notably from Laurent Garnier, for the original mix of the title track. We have also confirmed that reviews will appear in forthcoming issues of 7 and iDJ magazines. <br> <br> <b>Selected DJ Comments:</b> <br> <br> Laurent Garnier (F-Com) - "Will play that very jazzy track on the B-side. I'm sure it will rock the floor." 5/5 <br> <br> Nicky Holt (Soulsonic/7) - "3 smart tracks - very usable and very versatile." 4/5 (Charted #13) <br> <br> Lil' Dan (Classic/Stompaphunk) - "Plastic Avengers mix is superb - deep down druggy house." 5/5 <br> <br> James Zabiela (Various) - "Funktastic!" <br> <br> David Duriez (Various) - " 'Static Mind' is the perfect second dish for my Thursday evening dinner. I stay at the table, I want a dessert...Good." <br> <br> <b>MP3 Samples</b><br> It's Me (Original) - <a href="/media/djpeterk/itsmeoriginal.mp3"><b>play</b></a><br> It's Me (Plastic Avengers Remix - Static Mind) - <a href="/media/djpeterk/itsmeremix.mp3"><b>play</b></a> <br> <br> <b>Other Links</b><br> · <a href="artists.php?op=show&id=1183&genre=13">DJ Peter K Profile & MP3s</a> <br> &nbsp; <img src="themes/internetdj/images/header_extras.gif"> <br>&nbsp;<a href="search.php?topic=32"><b>More DJ News</b></a><br> <br><hr noshade size="1"> <b>Most read story in DJ News:</b><br>
